  "Add or edit your equipment during setup or in Settings under Your equipment. These home exercises stand in for Bryan's gym exercises.": "Dodajte ali uredite svojo opremo med nastavitvijo ali v nastavitvah v razdelku Vaša oprema. Te domače vaje nadomestijo Bryanove telovadne vaje.",
  "Add set": "Dodaj niz",
  "Add set is a labelled button at the end of the last set row. Set cards stay narrow and extra sets scroll inside their box.": "Dodaj niz je označen gumb na koncu zadnje vrstice niza. Komplet kartic ostane ozek, dodatni kompleti pa se pomikajo znotraj svoje škatle.",
  "Add set stays at the end of the last set row, and the timer and remove buttons line up across every row.": "Dodaj niz ostane na koncu zadnje nastavljene vrstice, gumba časovnika in odstranitve pa se razporedita čez vsako vrstico.",
  "Add weight only when you hit the top of the rep range on every set with clean form, two sessions in a row: about +{kg:1-2} per dumbbell for upper body, +{kg:2-4} for legs. Bryan’s protocol stresses progressive overload: increase the load gradually.": "Dodajte težo šele, ko dosežete vrh obsega ponovitev v vsaki seriji s čisto formo, dve seji zapored: približno +{kg:1-2} na utež za zgornji del telesa, +{kg:2-4} za noge. Bryanov protokol poudarja progresivno preobremenitev: obremenitev povečujte postopoma.",
  "Add weight only when you hit the top of the rep range on every set with clean form, two sessions in a row: about +0.5–1 kg per dumbbell for upper body, +1–2.5 kg for legs. Bryan’s protocol stresses progressive overload: increase the load gradually.": "Dodajte težo šele, ko dosežete vrh obsega ponovitev v vsaki seriji s čisto formo, dve seji zapored: približno +0,5–1 kg na utež za zgornji del telesa, +1–2,5 kg za noge. Bryanov protokol poudarja progresivno preobremenitev: obremenitev povečujte postopoma.",
  "Add your equipment names and product links, or skip this step and do it later in Settings. The animations show how the plan uses each accessory.": "Dodajte imena svoje opreme in povezave do izdelkov ali pa preskočite ta korak in to storite pozneje v nastavitvah. Animacije prikazujejo, kako načrt uporablja posamezen pripomoček.",
  "Add your own equipment below.": "Spodaj dodajte svojo opremo.",
  "Add-on": "Dodatek",
