  "An in-workout audio coach for interval training: spoken cues for work intervals, recovery blocks, heart-rate target reminders, 30-second warnings, and a voice toggle in the interval timer and Settings.": "Zvočni trener med vadbo za intervalno vadbo: govorjeni znaki za delovne intervale, blokade okrevanja, opomniki za ciljni srčni utrip, 30-sekundna opozorila in glasovni preklop v intervalnem časovniku in nastavitvah.",
  "Anchor a band at chest height behind you (door hinge side) or wrap it around your upper back.": "Pritrdite trak v višini prsnega koša za seboj (na strani tečaja vrat) ali ga ovijte okoli zgornjega dela hrbta.",
