  "At easier levels, move slowly until you learn the movement.": "Na lažjih stopnjah se premikajte počasi, dokler se gibanja ne naučite.",
  "At least 120 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 51 min of hard cardio a week; controlled vigorous blocks on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.": "Vsaj 120 minut načrtovane cone 2 in približno 51 minut težke kardio vadbe na teden; nadzorovane močne blokade v torek, četrtek in soboto.",
  "At New to training and Returning, keep the pace brisk and below all-out effort. At Active, work hard. At Well trained, use all-out effort.": "At New to training and Returning, ohrani tempo hiter in pod popolnim naporom. At Active, trdo delaj. At Well trained, potrudi se z vsemi močmi.",
  "At Returning and above, hold a dumbbell in each hand, or loop a band around your waist with its anchor in front of you. The band should pull you forward, like a sled.": "At Returning and above, držite bučico v vsaki roki ali si ovijte trak okoli pasu s sidrom pred seboj. Trak te mora vleči naprej, kot sani.",
  "At Returning, push back up with your hands. At higher levels, pull yourself back with your hamstrings.": "At Returning, potisnite nazaj navzgor z rokami. At higher levels, potegnite se nazaj s stegenskimi mišicami.",
  "At the end of your last interval, note your peak heart rate. Walk gently for 60 seconds and note your heart rate again. Enter the drop (peak minus 60s reading).": "Ob koncu zadnjega intervala si zabeležite svoj najvišji srčni utrip. Nežno hodite 60 sekund in znova zabeležite svoj srčni utrip. Vnesite padec (najvišja vrednost minus 60 s).",
