  "Balance is one of Bryan’s five exercise pillars (his May 2026 video). His free biological-age check uses a one-leg stand with eyes closed. Being able to stand on one leg for 10 s is linked with lower all-cause mortality.": "Ravnovesje je eden od Bryanovih petih stebrov vadbe (njegov video iz maja 2026). Njegovo brezplačno preverjanje biološke starosti uporablja enonožno stojalo z zaprtimi očmi. Zmožnost stati na eni nogi 10 s je povezana z nižjo umrljivostjo zaradi vseh vzrokov.",
  "Balance is one of Bryan's five exercise pillars. Balance decline closely mirrors cerebellar, vestibular and neurological brain aging.": "Ravnotežje je eden od Bryanovih petih stebrov vadbe. Upad ravnotežja natančno odraža cerebelarno, vestibularno in nevrološko staranje možganov.",
