  "Blueprint’s guidance after 40: strength train 2–3 times a week, cover the major muscle groups with compound movements and gradually increase reps or load. Start with bodyweight if new.": "Navodila načrta po 40. letu: vadite za moč 2–3-krat na teden, pokrijte glavne mišične skupine s sestavljenimi gibi in postopoma povečujte število ponovitev ali obremenitev. Začnite s telesno težo, če ste novi.",
  "Blueprint's title block names the exercise, and it dimensions steps and boxes only when there is one. Doodle has jokes for each kind of exercise and tallies the reps as they're counted; its speech bubble no longer covers the figure.": "Naslovni blok Blueprinta poimenuje vajo in dimenzionira korake in polja samo, če obstaja. Doodle ima šale za vsako vrsto vadbe in sešteva ponovitve, ko se štejejo; njegov govorni oblaček ne pokriva več figure.",
