  "Bryan adds a weighted vest during Zone 2 walks and hikes to increase axial bone loading safely.": "Bryan med sprehodi in pohodi po coni 2 doda obtežen jopič za varno povečanje aksialne obremenitve kosti.",
  "Bryan calls the phone the worst trigger for bad posture. Hold it at eye level and put the top of your monitor at eye level too.": "Bryan pravi, da je telefon najhujši sprožilec za slabo držo. Držite ga v višini oči in postavite vrh monitorja tudi v višino oči.",
  "Bryan calls this technical and was taught it for his own diagnosed condition. Stay gentle, and stop if you get dizziness, tingling or a headache.": "Bryan to imenuje tehnično in tega so ga naučili za lastno diagnosticirano bolezen. Bodite nežni in prenehajte, če dobite vrtoglavico, mravljinčenje ali glavobol.",
  "Bryan demo with timestamp": "Demo Bryan s časovnim žigom",
  "Bryan demonstrates it at {time} ({clock})": "Bryan to pokaže pri {time} ({clock})",
  "Bryan did 1 × 10 in 2023. His 2025 Galpin session includes Nordic curls in the strength block. They protect against hamstring strains.": "Bryan je leta 2023 naredil 1 × 10. Njegova seja Galpin leta 2025 vključuje nordijske kodre v bloku moči. Ščitijo pred obremenitvami stegenskih mišic.",
  "Bryan does “butterfly pulls” with a resistance band, 1 × 15. Most write-ups describe it as a band chest fly; watch his clip to copy his exact version.": "Bryan izvaja \"butterfly pulls\" z uporovnim trakom, 1 × 15. Večina zapisov ga opisuje kot trakovi na prsni koš; oglejte si njegov posnetek, da kopirate njegovo natančno različico.",
  "Bryan does 3 × 10 per leg, learned from Ben Patrick, the Knees-Over-Toes coach working with him on his 2026 dunk project. It builds the inner quad (VMO) and knee resilience.": "Bryan naredi 3 × 10 na nogo, se je naučil od Bena Patricka, trenerja Knees-Over-Toes, ki je sodeloval z njim pri njegovem projektu zabijanja 2026. Gradi notranjo štirikolesnico (VMO) in odpornost kolena.",
  "Bryan does both grips": "Bryan izvaja oba prijema",
  "Bryan does both. His 2025 Galpin session includes them in the strength block at 2 × 5–8. His official beginner list uses assisted pull-ups.": "Bryan dela oboje. Njegova seja Galpin leta 2025 jih vključuje v blok moči pri 2 × 5–8. Njegov uradni seznam začetnikov uporablja vleke z asistenco.",
  "Bryan does the Pallof press in his 2025 session with Dr. Andy Galpin. It trains the trunk to resist twisting.": "Bryan skrbi za tisk Pallof na svojem srečanju leta 2025 z dr. Andyjem Galpinom. Usposablja trup, da se upre zvijanju.",
  "Bryan does tibialis raises (1 × 25, single-leg in his list). His 2026 dunk notes mention limited ankle dorsiflexion. This exercise works on that movement.": "Bryan dviguje tibialis (1 × 25, ena noga na njegovem seznamu). Njegovi zapiski o zabijanju iz leta 2026 omenjajo omejeno dorzalno fleksijo gležnja. Ta vaja deluje na to gibanje.",
  "Bryan has been training to dunk at 49 since July 2026, using heavy lifts with jumps between sets. He says he needs more fast-twitch fibres and faster force development, and warns about Achilles risk from landing forces. Learn to land before working on height.": "Bryan od julija 2026 trenira zabijanje pri 49, pri čemer uporablja dvigovanje težkih tokov s skoki med serijami. Pravi, da potrebuje več hitrih vlaken in hitrejši razvoj sile, ter opozarja na nevarnost Ahila zaradi pristajanja sil. Naučite se pristati, preden delate na višini.",
  "Bryan Johnson": "Bryan Johnson",
