  "Bryan Johnson’s Workout Protocol": "Protokol vadbe Bryana Johnsona",
  "Bryan Johnson's zero-blood, at-home physical testing battery. Track your functional biomarkers against elite 18-year-old and longevity longevity percentiles.": "Baterija fizičnega testiranja brez krvi Bryana Johnsona na domu. Sledite svojim funkcionalnim biomarkerjem glede na elitne 18-letne in dolgoživostne percentile.",
  "Bryan measures grip strength as a primary longevity biomarker (scoring ~60 kg, top 5% of all ages). Hanging decompresses the spine and builds forearm grip endurance.": "Bryan meri moč prijema kot primarni biomarker dolgoživosti (točka ~60 kg, najboljših 5 % vseh starosti). Visenje razbremeni hrbtenico in poveča vzdržljivost prijema podlakti.",
  "Bryan on X: 10 squats every 45 minutes of sitting": "Bryan na X: 10 počepov vsakih 45 minut sedenja",
