  "Bryan: 60+ strict continuous reps (chest to floor, zero top pauses). Harvard study: 40+ push-ups correlated with 96% lower cardiovascular events.": "Bryan: 60+ strogih neprekinjenih ponovitev (prsi do tal, nič zgornjih pavz). Harvardska študija: 40+ sklec v korelaciji s 96 % nižjimi srčno-žilnimi dogodki.",
