  "Bryan: leg raises 1 × 50 on a captain’s chair. Your pull-up bar replaces the station.": "Bryan: dvig nog 1 × 50 na kapetanskem stolu. Vaša vlečna palica nadomešča postajo.",
  "Bryan: mechanical shockwave": "Bryan: mehanski udarni val",
