  "Bryan: seated calf raises 1 × 25. The standing single-leg version adds Achilles preparation for jumping, his own 2026 concern.": "Bryan: dvig teleta v sedečem položaju 1 × 25. Stoječa različica z eno nogo dodaja pripravo Ahila na skok, kar je njegova skrb leta 2026.",
  "Bryan: to fatigue, 2×/wk": "Bryan: do utrujenosti, 2×/teden",
  "Bryan’s 2025 Galpin session includes these in the speed and power block (2 × 5). You need about 2 m of clear floor to move sideways.": "Bryanova seja Galpin 2025 vključuje te v bloku hitrosti in moči (2 × 5). Za bočno premikanje potrebujete približno 2 m čistih tal.",
  "Bryan’s 2025 session has a rotational power slot (2 × 5), and his Bone Density protocol lists medicine-ball throws. Use a fast band chop at home.": "Bryanova seja 2025 ima rotacijsko moč (2 × 5), njegov protokol Bone Density pa navaja mete medicinske žogice. Doma uporabite hitri pas.",
  "Bryan’s 2026 dunk training is built on heavy pulls (a 385 lb, about 175 kg, PR on 4 Sep 2026, followed straight away by jumps), and his bone protocol names deadlifts. The dumbbell Romanian deadlift provides the heavy hip-hinge work in this plan.": "Bryanov trening zabijanja leta 2026 je zgrajen na težkih potegih (385 lb, približno 175 kg, PR 4. septembra 2026, čemur takoj sledijo skoki), njegov protokol s kostmi pa imenuje deadlifts. Romunsko mrtvo dviganje z utežmi zagotavlja težko delo na bokih v tem načrtu.",
  "Bryan’s Bone Density protocol (Apr 2026) puts jumping and hopping into the warm-up 4–7 times a week. He mentions stiff tendons and Achilles risk in his 2026 dunk training notes. This plan gives the tendons a small daily dose of work.": "Bryanov protokol Bone Density (apr. 2026) uvršča skakanje in poskoke med ogrevanje 4–7-krat na teden. V svojih zapiskih o treningu zabijanja leta 2026 omenja otrdele tetive in Ahilovo tveganje. Ta načrt daje kitam majhno dnevno dozo dela.",
  "Bryan’s Bone Density protocol (Apr 2026): high ground-reaction shockwaves stimulate osteoblast mineral deposition to maintain 99th percentile bone density.": "Bryanov protokol o kostni gostoti (apr. 2026): močni udarni valovi, ki se odzivajo na tla, spodbujajo odlaganje mineralov v osteoblastih, da se ohrani 99. percentil kostne gostote.",
  "Bryan’s Friday session in his newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026) includes step-ups at 3 × 10 per leg. His bone protocol also uses box step-ups for power training.": "Bryanova petkova vadba v njegovi najnovejši tedenski predlogi (glasilo o vadbi, 4. oktober 2026) vključuje korake po 3 × 10 na nogo. Njegov protokol za kosti uporablja tudi korake v boksu za trening moči.",
  "Bryan’s Friday template: lunges, overhead press, chest press, step-ups and side planks. Start with power work in Galpin’s order, then use Bryan’s 2026 pairing of heavy hip hinges followed by jumps.": "Bryanova petkova predloga: izpadni koraki, pritisk nad glavo, pritisk na prsi, stopnice in stranske deske. Začnite z močnim delom v Galpinovem vrstnem redu, nato uporabite Bryanovo kombinacijo 2026 težkih bokov, ki jim sledijo skoki.",
  "Bryan’s guide says holding good posture uses muscles that may feel sore at first. Sharp pain, tingling or headaches are reasons to stop and get checked.": "Bryanov vodnik pravi, da za dobro držo potrebujete mišice, ki se lahko na začetku počutijo boleče. Ostre bolečine, mravljinčenje ali glavoboli so razlogi, da se ustavite in opravite pregled.",
  "Bryan's gym exercise": "Bryanova vadba v telovadnici",
  "Bryan’s mobility and strength exercises, including pulling, Knees-Over-Toes work and high-rep arm work, followed by Zone 2 toward his weekly target. This is the first of two posture strength days.": "Bryanove vaje za mobilnost in moč, vključno z vlečenjem, delom s koleni čez prste in delom z rokami z veliko ponovitvami, čemur sledi 2. cona proti njegovemu tedenskemu cilju. To je prvi od dveh dni za krepitev telesne drže.",
  "Bryan’s official light day: 20–30 min of gentle yoga or stretching.": "Bryanov uradni svetlobni dan: 20–30 minut nežne joge ali raztezanja.",
  "Bryan’s official list: arm circles, wall slides, thread the needle, hip CARs.": "Bryanov uradni seznam: krogi za roke, diapozitivi, nit za iglo, CAR-ji za boke.",
  "Bryan’s official protocol includes both versions in its stability exercises: the single-leg RDL and single-leg toe touch.": "Bryanov uradni protokol vključuje obe različici vaj za stabilnost: RDL z eno nogo in dotik prstov z eno nogo.",
  "Bryan’s official warm-up uses arm circles, leg swings, high knees and lateral lunges. Hip CARs and the lunge with twist come from his mobility day and his 2025 warm-up with Dr. Andy Galpin.": "Bryanovo uradno ogrevanje uporablja kroge z rokami, zamahe z nogami, dvignjena kolena in bočne izpade. Hip CARs in skok z zasukom izhajajo iz njegovega dneva mobilnosti in njegovega ogrevanja leta 2025 z dr. Andyjem Galpinom.",
  "Bryan’s official yoga block includes cat-cow, cobbler’s pose, tree pose and cobra. Stay longer when you have time; his version lasts 15 min.": "Bryanov uradni blok joge vključuje mačko-kravo, čevljarsko pozo, pozo drevesa in kobro. Ostanite dlje, ko imate čas; njegova različica traja 15 min.",
  "Bryan’s physical-therapist exercise #1. Official wording (2026): “With weights in your hands, bring your shoulders up and out. Keep your elbows back. Do 1 set to fatigue 2 times a week.” He uses about 9 kg (20 lb); his posture coach’s patients usually start near 3.5 kg (8 lb).": "Bryanova fizioterapevtska vaja #1. Uradno besedilo (2026): \"Z utežmi v rokah dvignite ramena navzgor. Komolce držite nazaj. Naredite 1 niz do utrujenosti 2-krat na teden.\" Tehta približno 9 kg (20 lb); pacienti njegovega trenerja telesne drže običajno začnejo tehtati blizu 3,5 kg (8 lb).",
  "Bryan’s physical-therapist exercise #2. Official wording (2026): “With a hand on your forehead, resist the pressure of your hand pushing your head back. When doing this, be very patient.” He does it to fatigue twice a week.": "Bryanova fizioterapevtska vaja št. 2. Uradno besedilo (2026): \"Z roko na čelu se uprite pritisku roke, ki potiska glavo nazaj. Pri tem bodite zelo potrpežljivi.\" To počne do utrujenosti dvakrat na teden.",
  "Bryan’s posture coach walks him through the neck and shoulder exercises.": "Bryanov trener drže ga vodi skozi vaje za vrat in ramena.",
  "Bryan's protocol and home alternatives": "Bryanov protokol in domače alternative",
  "Bryan’s protocol: at least 150 min a week of moderate activity (Zone 2) during which you can hold a conversation.": "Bryanov protokol: vsaj 150 minut na teden zmerne aktivnosti (cona 2), med katero se lahko pogovarjate.",
  "Bryan's protocol: mechanical shock signals osteoblasts to deposit minerals. Keep knees slightly soft to protect cartilage while the bone absorbs the force.": "Bryanov protokol: mehanski šok sporoča osteoblastom, da odložijo minerale. Kolena naj bodo rahlo mehka, da zaščitite hrustanec, medtem ko kost absorbira silo.",
  "Bryan’s published options for bodyweight HIIT: jumping jacks, high knees, mountain climbers, burpees without the push-up, jump squats, plus marching and bodyweight squats for beginners.": "Bryanove objavljene možnosti za HIIT z lastno težo: skakalnice, visoka kolena, gorski plezalci, burpees brez sklece, skakalni počepi ter korakanje in počepi z lastno težo za začetnike.",
  "Bryan's rule: injury prevention comes first. Swap to the easier variant whenever a joint complains; never train through sharp pain.": "Bryanovo pravilo: preprečevanje poškodb je na prvem mestu. Zamenjajte na lažjo varianto, kadar se sklep pritožuje; nikoli ne trenirajte z ostro bolečino.",
  "Bryan's video or post": "Bryanov videoposnetek ali objava",
  "Bryan's weekly targets card in Activity → This week: strength, Zone 2, hard cardio, jumps, balance, mobility and posture.": "Bryanova kartica tedenskih ciljev v Dejavnost → Ta teden: moč, Cona 2, naporen kardio, skoki, ravnotežje, mobilnost in drža.",
