  "Choose a level below when you need an easier or harder workout. Past logs keep their original level.": "Izberite spodnjo raven, ko potrebujete lažjo ali težjo vadbo. Pretekli dnevniki ohranjajo prvotno raven.",
  "Choose a reason so you can see it later in History. You can return to your usual schedule or swap sessions when you're ready.": "Izberite razlog, da ga boste lahko videli pozneje v zgodovini. Lahko se vrnete na svoj običajni urnik ali zamenjate seje, ko ste pripravljeni.",
  "Choose a theme from these Today screenshots. Each shows a different exercise and animation style; you can choose your animation style below.": "Izberite temo s teh posnetkov zaslona Today. Vsak prikazuje drugačen stil vadbe in animacije; spodaj lahko izberete svoj slog animacije.",
  "Choose a theme to try its layout, fonts and colours. The screenshots show different animation styles; choose yours later in Settings. You can change either choice any time.": "Izberite temo, da preizkusite njeno postavitev, pisave in barve. Posnetki zaslona prikazujejo različne sloge animacije; izberite svojega pozneje v nastavitvah. Izbiro lahko kadar koli spremenite.",
  "Choose an easier or harder level. Past logs keep the level they were done at.": "Izberite lažjo ali težjo stopnjo. Pretekli dnevniki ohranjajo raven, na kateri so bili opravljeni.",
  "Choose any extra blocks you want after your workout. You can log them like the main session and change your choices in Settings.": "Po vadbi izberite dodatne bloke, ki jih želite. Prijavite jih lahko kot glavno sejo in spremenite svoje izbire v nastavitvah.",
  "Choose for a work interval": "Izberite delovni interval",
  "Choose from the indoor interval moves. Each has a quieter version.": "Izbirajte med notranjimi intervalnimi potezami. Vsak ima tišjo različico.",
  "Choose movements from this list for your intervals, then record them in the interval block.": "Izberite gibe s tega seznama za svoje intervale, nato pa jih zabeležite v intervalni blok.",
  "Choose the language for the app, the exercise instructions and the coach. You can change it later in Settings.": "Izberite jezik za aplikacijo, navodila za vadbo in trenerja. To lahko pozneje spremenite v nastavitvah.",
  "Choose the version prescribed in your workout": "Izberite različico, ki je predpisana v vaši vadbi",
