  "Guided exercise doses, set announcements, form cues during rest and spoken interval, hold and cardio timers.": "Vodeni odmerki vadbe, nastavite obvestila, namigi v obliki med počitkom in govorjenimi intervali, časovniki za zadrževanje in kardio.",
