  "Place a hand on your forehead and resist gentle backward pressure without moving your head.": "Položite roko na čelo in se uprite nežnemu pritisku nazaj, ne da bi premaknili glavo.",
  "place your hands on the mat. Use it for planks, floor work and stretches too.": "položite roke na podlogo. Uporabite ga tudi za deske, tla in raztezanja.",
  "Place your whole foot on the step. Push through that leg until you stand tall.": "Celo stopalo postavite na stopnico. Potisnite skozi to nogo, dokler ne stojite pokonci.",
  "Plan": "Načrt",
  "Plan and track six home workouts a week based on Bryan Johnson's public exercise protocol. You'll do strength training three days a week, plus short intervals, the Norwegian 4×4, Zone 2, balance and mobility. The workouts use bodyweight, adjustable dumbbells, a pull-up bar and bands.": "Načrtujte in spremljajte šest domačih vadb na teden na podlagi protokola javne vadbe Bryana Johnsona. Vaje za moč boste izvajali tri dni na teden, plus kratke intervale, norveški 4×4, Cona 2, ravnotežje in mobilnost. Pri vadbi se uporabljajo lastna teža, nastavljive uteži, palica za vlečenje in trakovi.",
  "Plan change history now lives in Settings instead of the Plan page.": "Zgodovina sprememb načrta je zdaj v nastavitvah namesto na strani načrta.",
  "Plan change:": "Sprememba načrta:",
  "Plan change: A new, gentler set of workouts for New to training: supported or smaller-range moves, 1 to 2 sets, no jumps, swings or Nordics, shorter intervals and Zone 2.": "Sprememba načrta: nov, nežnejši nabor vadb za začetnike v vadbi: podprti gibi ali gibi z manjšim obsegom, 1 do 2 niza, brez skokov, zamahov ali nordij, krajši intervali in cona 2.",
  "Plan change: Added two optional Blueprint micro-routine add-ons in Settings: Bone density protocol (heel drops & stomp drills, pogo hops, and landing drills from Bryan's bone health guide) and Dead hang & grip (passive and active bar hangs and farmer's holds for spinal decompression and grip longevity).": "Sprememba načrta: Dodana dva izbirna dodatka za mikro rutino Blueprint v nastavitvah: protokol za gostoto kosti (spusti pete in udarne vaje, pogo skoki in vaje za pristajanje iz Bryanovega vodnika za zdravje kosti) in Dead hang & grip (pasivni in aktivni visovi na palici in kmečki prijemi za dekompresijo hrbtenice in dolgoživost oprijema).",
  "Plan change: Changing your training level in Settings now switches you to that level's workouts: weights rescale and your phase restarts from the level's starting point.": "Sprememba načrta: Če spremenite raven vadbe v nastavitvah, vas zdaj preklopi na vadbe te stopnje: uteži se ponovno merijo in vaša faza se znova začne od začetne točke ravni.",
  "Plan change: Clarified the setup notes for ATG split squats, single-leg toe touches, band pull-aparts, standing external rotation, side planks and side-to-side leg swings.": "Sprememba načrta: Pojasnjene so bile opombe o postavitvi za ATG split počepe, dotike prstov na eni nogi, raztezanje traku, zunanjo rotacijo stoje, stranske deske in zamahe nog z ene strani na drugo.",
  "Plan change: Combined warm-ups and exercise variations now appear as separate movements. Guided pairs alternate one set at a time, keeping the existing doses.": "Sprememba načrta: kombinirano ogrevanje in različice vadbe so zdaj prikazani kot ločeni gibi. Vodeni pari izmenjujejo en niz naenkrat, pri čemer ohranjajo obstoječe odmerke.",
  "Plan change: Phases (Re-entry, Build, Blueprint), their automatic advance after 12 and 24 sessions, the phase lock and the starting-phase setting.": "Sprememba načrta: Faze (ponovni vstop, izgradnja, načrt), njihov samodejni napredek po 12 in 24 sejah, fazno zaklepanje in nastavitev začetne faze.",
  "Plan change: Scheduled Zone 2 and controlled vigorous cardio scale by level toward Bryan’s weekly targets of 150 minutes of Zone 2 and 75 minutes of hard cardio.": "Sprememba načrta: Načrtovana cona 2 in nadzorovana intenzivna kardio vadba po stopnjah proti Bryanovim tedenskim ciljem 150 minut cone 2 in 75 minut trde kardio vadbe.",
  "Plan change: Setup no longer asks you to pick a starting phase: your training level decides it. \"Well trained\" now starts in Blueprint (was Build).": "Sprememba načrta: Nastavitev ne zahteva več, da izberete začetno fazo: o tem odloča vaša stopnja usposabljanja. \"Dobro usposobljeni\" se zdaj začne v načrtu (prej Build).",
  "Plan change: Side-to-side leg swings say \"Stand tall with one hand on the wall\" (the animation stands square, not side-on).": "Sprememba načrta: zamahi z nogami iz ene strani v drugo pravijo: \"Stojte pokončno z eno roko na steni\" (animacija stoji pravokotno, ne stransko).",
  "Plan change: Single-leg balance and the forehead-resistance hold no longer state a fixed time or count that differs from your level; their animation cues now point to the time or holds your level prescribes.": "Sprememba načrta: Ravnotežje z eno nogo in držanje z uporom na čelu ne določata več fiksnega časa ali števila, ki se razlikuje od vaše ravni; njihovi animacijski znaki zdaj kažejo na čas ali zadržujejo predpisano raven.",
  "Plan change: Step-ups use a low aerobic step; Poliquin heel taps start on a slant board on the floor, with matching animations.": "Sprememba načrta: pri korakih se uporablja nizek aerobni korak; Poliquin udarci pete se začnejo na poševni deski na tleh z ustreznimi animacijami.",
  "Plan change: Well trained includes all target cardio without extra walks; keeping the strength work makes sessions 72 to 93 minutes.": "Sprememba načrta: dobro treniran vključuje vse ciljne kardio vadbe brez dodatnih sprehodov; ohranjanje dela moči naredi seje od 72 do 93 minut.",
  "Plan change: Your training level alone now sets the workouts. Each of the four levels (New to training, Returning, Active, Well trained) has its own sets, reps, intervals and Zone 2 minutes; nothing moves on by itself. Your weight, sex and age still scale the suggested weights.": "Sprememba načrta: samo vaša raven vadbe zdaj določa vadbe. Vsaka od štirih stopenj (novi v vadbi, povratnik, aktiven, dobro treniran) ima svoje serije, ponovitve, intervale in minute cone 2; nič se ne premakne samo od sebe. Vaša teža, spol in starost še vedno določajo predlagane teže.",
