  "Settings": "Nastavitve",
  "Settings → Animation style: a live preview of Zone 2, a card with a still of each style, and Try styles live, which opens Zone 2 with a numbered switcher at the top of the screen, like the theme switcher. Both switchers can be open at once.": "Nastavitve → Slog animacije: predogled Cone 2 v živo, kartica s posnetkom vsakega sloga in Preizkusite sloge v živo, ki odpre Cono 2 z oštevilčenim preklopnikom na vrhu zaslona, ​​kot je preklopnik tem. Oba stikala sta lahko odprta hkrati.",
  "Settings → Animation style: pick which exercise the preview and the style cards show.": "Nastavitve → Slog animacije: izberite, katero vadbo prikažejo predogled in kartice slogov.",
  "Settings → Appearance now puts Light or dark first, then Try themes live, then the theme screenshots.": "Nastavitve → Videz zdaj najprej postavi Svetlo ali Temno, nato Preizkusite teme v živo in nato posnetke zaslona teme.",
  "Settings → Voice coach": "Nastavitve → Glasovni trener",
  "Settings links to the GitHub repository and the full changelog on GitHub.": "Povezave nastavitev do repozitorija GitHub in celotnega dnevnika sprememb na GitHubu.",
  "Settings refreshes the installed version when opened; the server no longer keeps an old version after an update.": "Nastavitve ob odprtju osvežijo nameščeno različico; strežnik po posodobitvi ne hrani več stare različice.",
  "Settings shows name, age, weight and height on one line, with the name field largest, and sex beside units.": "Nastavitve prikazujejo ime, starost, težo in višino v eni vrstici, z največjim poljem z imenom in spolom poleg enot.",
  "Settings shows the app version and opens the five latest release notes.": "Nastavitve prikažejo različico aplikacije in odprejo pet najnovejših opomb ob izdaji.",
  "Settings shows the manual level picker first, with the level check collapsed below it.": "Nastavitve najprej prikažejo ročni izbirnik ravni, pod njim pa je strnjeno preverjanje ravni.",
  "Settings stays responsive on open by loading animation previews only when they are near the screen.": "Nastavitve ostanejo odzivne, ko se odprejo, tako da naložijo predoglede animacij le, ko so blizu zaslona.",
  "Setup has a new Accessories step: what you need at home (dumbbells, pull-up bar, bands, mat, slant board, step or box, Nordic anchor), each shown in a 3D example exercise.": "Nastavitev ima nov korak dodatne opreme: kar potrebujete doma (uteži, palica za vleko, trakovi, podloga, poševna deska, stopnica ali škatla, nordijsko sidro), kar je prikazano v 3D vzorčni vaji.",
  "Setup has a new Theme step right after Welcome.": "Nastavitev ima nov korak teme takoj za dobrodošlico.",
