  "Spend 3–4 minutes stimulating bone mineral density through high-impact ground-reaction loading. Includes heel drops & stomp drills, pogo hops and snap-down landings from Bryan's bone health protocol.": "Porabite 3–4 minute za spodbujanje mineralne gostote kosti z močno udarno obremenitvijo s tlemi. Vključuje vaje za spuščanje pete in topotanje, pogo hops in pristanke s pristankom iz Bryanovega protokola za zdravje kosti.",
