  "Thread the needle": "Vtaknite nit v iglo",
  "Three demonstration videos for every exercise: two technique videos and one short, focused clip. When Bryan has a video it still opens first and stays the default.": "Trije predstavitveni videoposnetki za vsako vajo: dva videa tehnike in en kratek, osredotočen posnetek. Ko ima Bryan videoposnetek, se še vedno odpre prvi in ​​ostane privzet.",
  "Thu": "čet",
  "Thursday": "četrtek",
  "Thursday in Bryan’s newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026): 4 rounds of 4 min at 85–95% of max heart rate with 3 min at 60–70% between, at a hard, controlled pace below an all-out sprint, starting with 2–3 rounds if four is too much. Bryan’s own variant (X, Dec 2024) is 4 min all-out with 4 min rest.": "Četrtek v Bryanovi najnovejši tedenski predlogi (glasilo o vadbi, 4. oktober 2026): 4 krogi po 4 minute pri 85–95 % maksimalnega srčnega utripa s 3 minutami pri 60–70 % vmes, v močnem, nadzorovanem tempu pod popolnim sprintom, začenši z 2–3 krogi, če so štirje preveč. Bryanova lastna različica (X, december 2024) je 4 minute vsega skupaj s 4 minutami počitka.",
  "Thursday, October 1": "Četrtek, 1. oktober",
  "Thursday, October 15": "Četrtek, 15. oktober",
  "Thursday, October 22": "Četrtek, 22. oktober",
  "Thursday, October 29": "Četrtek, 29. oktober",
