  "Train strength on Monday, Wednesday and Friday, do short intervals on Tuesday and the Norwegian 4×4 on Thursday, then mixed cardio on Saturday. Rest on Sunday. Zone 2 and controlled vigorous blocks build toward Bryan Johnson's weekly cardio targets. His public protocol is adapted here for bodyweight, adjustable dumbbells, a pull-up bar and bands.": "V ponedeljek, sredo in petek trenirajte moč, v torek izvajajte kratke intervale, v četrtek pa norveški 4×4, nato pa mešani kardio v soboto. V nedeljo počitek. Cona 2 in nadzorovane močne blokade se približujejo tedenskim kardio ciljem Bryana Johnsona. Njegov javni protokol je tukaj prilagojen za lastno težo, nastavljive uteži, palico za vlečenje in trakove.",
