  "Try themes live in Settings → Appearance: opens Today with a small switcher floating at the top of the screen, one letter per theme (A Original to G Course). Hover a letter to see its name, keep using any page while you compare, and close it with × (or Escape). It stays open across pages and reloads until you close it.": "Preizkusite teme v živo v nastavitvah → Videz: odpre se danes z majhnim stikalom, ki lebdi na vrhu zaslona, ​​ena črka na temo (tečaj A Original to G). Premaknite miškin kazalec na črko, da vidite njeno ime, še naprej uporabljajte katero koli stran, medtem ko primerjate, in jo zaprite s × (ali Escape). Ostaja odprt na straneh in se znova naloži, dokler ga ne zaprete.",
