  "Tuesday: Intervals 1 · 20-second bursts + Zone 2 + back & core": "Torek: Intervali 1 · 20-sekundni rafali + Cona 2 + nazaj in jedro",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at {hr:85-95}.": "Torek: dva bloka po 8 × 20 s all-out. Četrtek: polni norveški 4×4 pri {hr:85-95}.",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at 159–178 bpm.": "Torek: dva bloka po 8 × 20 s all-out. Četrtek: polni norveški 4×4 pri 159–178 bpm.",
