  "Turn coaching on once to save the included recordings for playback. No audio is unpacked before that.": "Enkrat vklopite coaching, da shranite vključene posnetke za predvajanje. Pred tem se zvok ne razpakira.",
  "Turn each add-on on or off, choose how often it repeats (daily or every 2–7 days), and decide whether it appears on Sunday. A repeat counts from the day you set it; Sunday only changes whether the add-on appears that day.": "Vklopite ali izklopite vsak dodatek, izberite, kako pogosto se ponavlja (vsak dan ali vsakih 2–7 dni) in se odločite, ali se prikaže v nedeljo. Ponovitev se šteje od dneva, ko ste jo nastavili; Nedelja spremeni samo to, ali se dodatek pojavi tisti dan.",
  "Turn from your hips and pivot your back foot. Let the turn drive the movement through your arms.": "Obrnite se z bokov in zavrtite zadnjo nogo. Pustite, da obrat poganja gibanje skozi vaše roke.",
