  "Turning coaching on copies the included audio instead of generating a voice pack locally; speech can play while the rest copies.": "Vklop coachinga kopira vključen zvok namesto lokalnega generiranja glasovnega paketa; govor se lahko predvaja, medtem ko ostali kopirajo.",
